  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Programme Coordination Office for DDiN2 is a component of Deepening Democracy in Nigeria 2 (DDIN2) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;964,637. It works in the following sector(s): Elections, Public sector policy and administrative management, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Democratic participation and civil society, Media and free flow of information, Human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
